==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|коса́тый|t1=having pigtails ({{m|ru|коси́чки}})|-ик}}. Original meaning was "male swallow".

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|каса́тик}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|каса́тик|a=ai}}

# {{lb|ru|dated|colloquial|animate}} {{n-g|affectionate address to a male}}
#: {{syn|ru|дорого́й|ми́лый}}
# [[iris]] (plant) (''[[Iris#Translingual|Iris]]'')
#: {{syn|ru|и́рис}}
# male [[swallow]] (bird)
#: {{syn|ru|ла́сточка<q:swallow>}}

